# Open 25.1
tags: open, benchmark, 2025
stimulus: Ascending couplet with a lunge built in; the rounds get long fast.
note: Each round adds 3 reps to the burpees and to the hang clean-to-overheads. The lunge is 30 ft per round (2 x 15 ft), each 15 ft section counting as 1 rep; no partial credit at the cap.
3-6-9 ... for time, cap 15:00
  Burpee ("lateral over the dumbbell")
  Dumbbell hang clean-to-overhead 50/35 lb
  30 ft Lunge

Scaled:
  Dumbbell hang clean-to-overhead 35/20 lb
